Icons
=====

chromium/
---------

The `.icon` files in `chromium/` are copied unchanged from the Chromium source
tree (`components/vector_icons/`, `chrome/app/vector_icons/`,
`ui/views/vector_icons/`). The `.svg` files beside them are 1:1 conversions
made with `tools/icon2svg.py`: same canvas size, same path commands, color
replaced by `currentColor`.

