https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/src/+/main/LICENSE (BSD 3-Clause).
The full license text is also in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.

Only generic Material/UI glyphs are included (arrows, reload, home, star,
puzzle piece, three-dot menu, globe, lock, person avatar, and similar). No
Google or Chrome logos, wordmarks, product icons, or the dinosaur are
included.

window/
-------

`minimize.svg`, `maximize.svg`, `restore.svg`, and `close.svg` are thin
geometric caption glyphs written for Mithu and are under the same license as Mithu (Apache-2.0).
